{"seq":3,"slug":"online-routing-bandits","title":"在线路由与赌博机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-routing-cascades/training/online-routing-bandits","wordCount":1628,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"在线路由与赌博机\">在线路由与赌博机</h1><p>离线训好的路由器有个躲不掉的命运：它一上线就开始过时。流量分布在漂移、模型厂商在更新版本、新模型在加入池子，而离线训练数据是某个时间切片的快照。冷启动那节（<a href=\"routing-data\">路由数据与标注</a>）的第三阶段已经点到——上线后要让路由器从生产反馈里持续学。把这件事建模成一个上下文赌博机（contextual bandit）问题，是 2025 年这一方向的主流答案。本节讲清楚为什么是赌博机而非普通监督学习、探索与利用怎么权衡、以及 LinUCB 这条主线算法。核心张力一句话：你只能观察到「实际选中的那个模型」的反馈，看不到「没选的模型本会怎样」，这让在线路由天然是个赌博机而非回归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么是赌博机\">核心概念：为什么是赌博机</h2><p>普通监督学习假设每个样本都有完整标签。但线上路由不是——一个请求来了，你只能把它送给一个模型、只看到那个模型的结果，永远不知道「要是送给另一个模型会更好还是更差」。这种「只看得到选中臂的反馈」正是赌博机的定义。请求的特征是上下文（context），候选模型是臂（arm），用户对回答的反馈（点赞/重试/任务成功）是奖励（reward）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  X[请求到达:上下文 x] --&gt; P[路由策略]&#10;  P --&gt; A[选一个模型臂 m]&#10;  A --&gt; R[观察奖励 r&lt;br/&gt;点赞/重试/成功]&#10;  R --&gt; U[更新策略&lt;br/&gt;只对选中的臂]&#10;  U --&gt; P&#10;  X2[下一个请求] --&gt; P\">flowchart TD\n  X[请求到达:上下文 x] --&gt; P[路由策略]\n  P --&gt; A[选一个模型臂 m]\n  A --&gt; R[观察奖励 r&lt;br/&gt;点赞/重试/成功]\n  R --&gt; U[更新策略&lt;br/&gt;只对选中的臂]\n  U --&gt; P\n  X2[下一个请求] --&gt; P</pre><p>由此引出在线路由的灵魂矛盾——探索与利用（exploration vs exploitation）。利用是「按当前最优估计选模型」，稳但可能错过更好的；探索是「偶尔试试估计不那么高的模型」，为了收集反馈、修正估计。全利用会让路由器永远困在初始偏见里（某个其实变强了的模型因为早期表现差被永久冷落）；全探索则白白浪费请求在次优模型上。赌博机算法的全部技巧就是平衡这两者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"linucb-用置信上界驱动探索\">LinUCB：用置信上界驱动探索</h2><p>把奖励假设成上下文的线性函数，就得到这一方向的主力算法 LinUCB。它给每个模型臂 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 维护一个权重向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，预测请求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 在该臂的期望奖励为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{r}_m = x^\\top \\theta_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9991em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，并给这个预测配一个不确定性宽度。选臂时不选预测最高的，而选「预测加上不确定性」最高的：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^* = \\arg\\max_m \\Big( x^\\top \\hat{\\theta}_m + \\alpha \\sqrt{x^\\top A_m^{-1} x} \\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.85em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9479em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2979em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2579em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5421em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一项是利用（当前最优估计），第二项是探索奖励——一个模型被试得越少，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_m^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0611em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大、这一项越大，于是它更可能被选去收集数据。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 调探索强度。这套「乐观面对不确定性」的思路能给出可证明的 sublinear regret（累积遗憾随时间次线性增长，即长期平均逼近最优）。2025 年一批工作把它用到 LLM 路由：PILOT 在 LinUCB 上融合离线人类偏好做初始化，MixLLM 用上下文赌博机加策略梯度、上线后用二元用户反馈持续更新（<a href=\"https://ojs.aaai.org/index.php/AAAI/article/download/39672/43633\">Online Multi-LLM Selection via Contextual Bandits, AAAI 2025</a>）。</p>\n<p>下表把在线路由和离线路由的取舍摆清楚。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>离线训练路由器</th>\n<th>在线赌博机路由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>反馈</td>\n<td>训练时一次性全标</td>\n<td>边服务边逐条收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适应漂移</td>\n<td>不能，需重训</td>\n<td>能，持续更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>探索成本</td>\n<td>无（不上线）</td>\n<td>有，部分请求送次优臂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动</td>\n<td>要现成数据</td>\n<td>可从零起步（但前期差）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（要在线基建）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"把离线和在线缝起来\">把离线和在线缝起来</h2><p>纯在线赌博机从零起步，冷启动期表现差、还要承担探索成本，不实用。务实方案是离线-在线混合：用离线训练的路由器（<a href=\"router-training\">路由器训练</a>）初始化赌博机的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，让它一上线就有不错的起点，再用在线反馈持续微调、吸收漂移。PILOT 正是这个思路——离线人类偏好定下先验、在线评价反馈做更新。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Off[离线训练:偏好数据] --&gt; Init[初始化臂参数 θ]&#10;  Init --&gt; On[上线:赌博机服务]&#10;  On --&gt; Fb[收集线上反馈]&#10;  Fb --&gt; Up[小步更新 θ]&#10;  Up --&gt; On&#10;  Drift[模型版本变/分布漂移] --&gt; On\">flowchart TD\n  Off[离线训练:偏好数据] --&gt; Init[初始化臂参数 θ]\n  Init --&gt; On[上线:赌博机服务]\n  On --&gt; Fb[收集线上反馈]\n  Fb --&gt; Up[小步更新 θ]\n  Up --&gt; On\n  Drift[模型版本变/分布漂移] --&gt; On</pre><p>这样既避开冷启动的痛、又保住对漂移的适应力。它和缓存、批处理等在线系统优化是正交的：赌博机管「选哪个模型」，吞吐与延迟优化管「选中之后怎么运行」。两者在生产里可以叠加，却需要分开的策略版本、指标和故障归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在线路由的现实坑\">在线路由的现实坑</h2><p>最后泼点冷水。在线路由听上去优雅，工程上有三个硬坑。其一是<strong>奖励信号又稀又噪</strong>——用户很少明确反馈，「重试」「修改」这些隐式信号噪声大、还有延迟（用户可能几分钟后才表达不满），赌博机更新得在延迟、稀疏的奖励下工作。其二是<strong>探索有真实代价</strong>——每次把请求送给次优模型，都是一次真实用户体验的牺牲，探索强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 设大了用户受罪、设小了学得慢。其三是<strong>非平稳性</strong>——模型版本一换，之前学的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可能瞬间失效，纯 LinUCB 假设奖励分布平稳，得加遗忘机制（衰减旧数据）才扛得住真实的频繁更新。怎么在这些约束下稳妥上线，是 <a href=\"../practice/routing-in-practice\">落地与权衡</a> 的话题；本节只确立：在线学习是应对漂移的正解，但它把复杂度从「训练」搬到了「运维」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>在线路由天然是上下文赌博机：只观察到选中模型的反馈、看不到未选模型的反事实，无法当普通监督回归。</li>\n<li>灵魂矛盾是探索与利用——全利用困在初始偏见、全探索浪费请求；赌博机算法平衡两者。</li>\n<li>LinUCB 用「预测奖励 + 不确定性宽度」选臂，给少试的模型探索加成，可证明 sublinear regret；PILOT、MixLLM 等 2025 工作把它落到 LLM 路由。</li>\n<li>务实方案是离线-在线混合：离线路由器初始化赌博机参数避开冷启动，在线反馈持续微调吸收漂移。</li>\n<li>现实三坑：奖励稀疏带噪有延迟、探索牺牲真实用户体验、模型更新带来非平稳性需加遗忘机制。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一节：<a href=\"routing-data\">路由数据与标注</a> —— 冷启动三阶段，本节是其第三阶段。</li>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"router-training\">路由器训练</a> —— 离线训出的路由器用作赌博机的初始化。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/routing-in-practice\">落地与权衡</a> —— 在线路由的漂移与上线节奏。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"在线路由与赌博机","id":"在线路由与赌博机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么是赌博机","id":"核心概念-为什么是赌博机"},{"level":2,"text":"LinUCB：用置信上界驱动探索","id":"linucb-用置信上界驱动探索"},{"level":2,"text":"把离线和在线缝起来","id":"把离线和在线缝起来"},{"level":2,"text":"在线路由的现实坑","id":"在线路由的现实坑"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"路由数据与标注","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-routing-cascades/training/routing-data"},"next":{"title":"路由网关与中间件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-routing-cascades/practice/routing-gateways"}}